{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/5774d7eba26d69e025261086fbca6b48.poster.avif?t=1773764677\" width=1170 height=650 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/5774d7eba26d69e025261086fbca6b48.webm?t=1773764677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/5774d7eba26d69e025261086fbca6b48.mp4?t=1773764677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Maude, a graffiti artist compelled to tag up the walls of a nightclub at every possible opportunity. As you move your way past bouncers and drunk club goers you come to discover there\u2019s more to Club Soko than meets the eye.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100+ handcrafted puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An undo system to work through past mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 chapters each with their own music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 unlockable cameo characters to discover from other true indie devs, artists, and indie games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 different kinds of puzzle pieces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 types of secret rooms to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill music mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puke toggle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first puzzle game in the world with a circle pit!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3346410?t=1773764677","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773764677","capsule_image":"https://shared.aka